[
    {
        "content": "<p>In </p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">scoped</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">notation</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">51</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.....</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Can i replace the 51 by a variable, so that i can use it at multiple points and only have to change it once?</p>",
        "id": 578025195,
        "sender_full_name": "Moritz Roos",
        "timestamp": 1772991087
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Do you want to change the precedence of one notation as you go or build a template to write multiple notations?</p>",
        "id": 578025566,
        "sender_full_name": "Henrik Böving",
        "timestamp": 1772991397
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>A constant would be ok as well. I have 5 notations using the same syntax only differentiated by inputs.<br>\nI want all of them to have the same precedence</p>",
        "id": 578025696,
        "sender_full_name": "Moritz Roos",
        "timestamp": 1772991495
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>If i forget to change one, weird things happen</p>",
        "id": 578025705,
        "sender_full_name": "Moritz Roos",
        "timestamp": 1772991504
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>so i wanted to have a single value that i can reuse at all 5 locations</p>",
        "id": 578025748,
        "sender_full_name": "Moritz Roos",
        "timestamp": 1772991542
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>something like <code>max</code> already is</p>",
        "id": 578025798,
        "sender_full_name": "Moritz Roos",
        "timestamp": 1772991583
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Looking at Init/Notation.lean i should be able to do</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">macro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"myprio\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">prio</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">prio</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">51</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myfunc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">notation</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">myprio</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\":::\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myfunc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">check</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">::</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 578026162,
        "sender_full_name": "Moritz Roos",
        "timestamp": 1772991924
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>but i get <br>\n<code>unexpected token ':'; expected '=&gt;'</code> from the <code>:</code> at the <code>notation</code> command</p>",
        "id": 578026193,
        "sender_full_name": "Moritz Roos",
        "timestamp": 1772991954
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Ah, i confused <code>prio</code> and <code>prec</code></p>",
        "id": 578026448,
        "sender_full_name": "Moritz Roos",
        "timestamp": 1772992284
    },
    {
        "content": "<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">macro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"myprec\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">prec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">prec</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">51</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myfunc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">notation</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">myprec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\":::\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myfunc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">check</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">::</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>this works!</p>",
        "id": 578026451,
        "sender_full_name": "Moritz Roos",
        "timestamp": 1772992289
    }
